<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 2.x Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="_Toc235450408" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 2 — Table with a &lt;caption&gt; element</title>
   <refbody>
      <section id="sec_d737e7">
         <p>Consider a configuration parameter table where a <codeph>&lt;caption&gt;</codeph> element is inside the <codeph>&lt;table&gt;</codeph> element above the header.</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Table with caption element</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>HTML Input</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>DITA Output</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_qzp_fb4_lkc">
&lt;table>
  &lt;caption>Server Configuration Parameters&lt;/caption>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;th>Parameter&lt;/th>
    &lt;th>Default Value&lt;/th>
    &lt;th>Description&lt;/th>
  &lt;/tr>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;td>Port&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>8080&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>Server listening port.&lt;/td>
  &lt;/tr>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;td>Timeout&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>60&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>Session timeout in seconds.&lt;/td>
  &lt;/tr>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;td>Enable SSL&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>True&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>Enables encrypted communication.&lt;/td>
  &lt;/tr>
&lt;/table></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_dc5_2b4_lkc">
&lt;reference id="server_configuration_parameters">
  &lt;title>Server Configuration Parameters&lt;/title>
  &lt;refbody>
    &lt;table>
      &lt;title>Server Configuration Parameters&lt;/title>
      &lt;tgroup cols="3">
        &lt;colspec colname="c1"/>
        &lt;colspec colname="c2"/>
        &lt;colspec colname="c3"/>
        &lt;thead>
          &lt;row>
            &lt;entry>Parameter&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Default Value&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Description&lt;/entry>
          &lt;/row>
        &lt;/thead>
        &lt;tbody>
          &lt;row>
            &lt;entry>Port&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>8080&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Server listening port.&lt;/entry>
          &lt;/row>
          &lt;row>
            &lt;entry>Timeout&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>60&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Session timeout in seconds.&lt;/entry>
          &lt;/row>
          &lt;row>
            &lt;entry>Enable SSL&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>True&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Enables encrypted communication.&lt;/entry>
          &lt;/row>
        &lt;/tbody>
      &lt;/tgroup>
    &lt;/table>
  &lt;/refbody>
&lt;/reference></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
         <p>
            <b>Result:</b> The converter produces a CALS <codeph>&lt;table&gt;</codeph> + <codeph>&lt;tgroup&gt;</codeph> because a <codeph>&lt;caption&gt;</codeph> element is present. The <codeph>&lt;caption&gt;</codeph> text is mapped to the DITA <codeph>&lt;title&gt;</codeph> element inside <codeph>&lt;table&gt;</codeph>.</p>
         <note type="note"> Always use the native HTML <codeph>&lt;caption&gt;</codeph> element to add captions to tables. Only <codeph>&lt;caption&gt;</codeph> elements are mapped to DITA <codeph>&lt;title&gt;</codeph> elements. A <codeph>&lt;p&gt;</codeph> element placed above a table and used as a visual caption is mapped to a <codeph>&lt;p&gt;</codeph> element, not a <codeph>&lt;title&gt;</codeph>.</note>
      </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>
